{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     Approach then take object, check properties, move to drop off, and drop object.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <SubTree ID = PerformObjectCheck    /> <Action ID = DropObject    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToDropOffLocation    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    />",
